  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium-high heat. ",
    "Thread chicken breast, onion, bell pepper, and lemon zest onto skewers. ",
    "In a small bowl, mix together peanut brittle, paprika, cumin, coriander, garlic powder, salt-free seasoning blend, and black pepper. ",
    "Brush skewers with olive oil and sprinkle with peanut brittle mixture. ",
    "Grill skewers for 10 minutes per side, or until chicken is cooked through. ",
    "Let skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
